# Bazel's convenience symlinks. They point into one version's output base, and
# switching Bazel versions in the same checkout (CI covers 8.6.0 and 9.2.0)
# leaves the new version walking the old tree, where it dies on whatever
# external repo it finds first.
bazel-bin
bazel-out
bazel-protoc-gen-clojure
bazel-testlogs
